  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IDF-Combating Corruption Strengthening Anti Corruption Capacity in the Office of the Prosecutor General</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This proposal is based on a strong request from the Bulgarian authorities including and especially from the new Prosecutor General Mr Velchev who has emerged in recent months as a crusader against entrenched corruption in Bulgaria. The European Commission also strongly supports assistance for the Supreme Cassation Prosecution Office (SCPO) as part of the drive to combat corruption in Bulgaria and strengthen accountability in the functioning of the judicial branch, of which the SCPO is a key element. The proposed IDF will assist the SCPO to: (i) consultatively design and implement a strategy and action plan to strengthen SCPO anti-corruption capacity and public accountability; (ii) enhance internal accountability and combat corruption through electronic declarations of income and assets; (iii) strengthen SCPO public accountability through CSO/NGO monitoring of SCPO performance and reforms. TF058170</narrative>
  </description>
